Hello,

To confirm your boot disk, you can type "/sbin/consvar -g
bootdef_dev".

Also, here's a shell script that provides a little more verbosity
(should be able to cut & paste paste it to your Tru64 system):


#!/bin/ksh
#Display console boot device
CONSVAR=3D/sbin/consvar
WHOAMI=3D`whoami`
export CONSVAR WHOAMI
if [[ $WHOAMI !=3D root ]]
then
echo "\nThis script must be run by root, exiting..\n"
